  "concept": {
    "description": "Personalized Revengeance-style precision cyborg: olive/charcoal layered ceramic armor, exposed braided actuators and genuinely articulated mechanical limbs, stronger black anatomical-left arm assembly recalling her long sleeve, olive anatomical-right precision hand, shoulder/cheek interfaces designed for her conventional sniper rifle, low-profile backpack and practical articulated boots. No generic shiny cloth, no Raiden body copy, no extra limbs."
  },
